msgid ""
"The APM2.6 board is no longer supported for Copter. From Copter 3.3 firmware"
" (and later) no longer fits on APM boards. The last firmware builds that can"
" be installed (AC v3.2.1) can be downloaded from here: `APM2.x "
"<https://download.ardupilot.org/downloads/wiki/firmware/ArduCopter_APM_2.0_Firmware_3.2.1.zip>`__"
" and `APM1.x "
"<https://download.ardupilot.org/downloads/wiki/firmware/ArduCopter_APM_1.0_Firmware_3.2.1.zip>`__"
msgstr ""
"APM2.6 飞控板已不再支持 Copter。从 Copter 3.3 固件（及更高版本）起，固件已无法装入 APM "
"板。可以安装的最后一个固件版本（AC v3.2.1）可从以下地址下载：`APM2.x "
"<https://download.ardupilot.org/downloads/wiki/firmware/ArduCopter_APM_2.0_Firmware_3.2.1.zip>`__"
" 和 `APM1.x "
"<https://download.ardupilot.org/downloads/wiki/firmware/ArduCopter_APM_1.0_Firmware_3.2.1.zip>`__"

#: ../../source/docs/common-apm25-and-26-overview.rst:27
#: 16c84073e98a4f90a05a36305250ee17 4ee279c668d640b4928e73f71b8cb1c4
msgid ""
"The APM2.6 board is no longer supported for Plane. The last firmware build "
"that fits on the APM is Plane 3.3.0."
msgstr "APM2.6 飞控板已不再支持 Plane。APM 可运行的最后一个固件版本为 Plane 3.3.0。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-apm25-and-26-overview.rst:17
#: ../../source/docs/common-apm25-and-26-overview.rst:31
#: 0a3979fa94194d7abad93a59fd7d87e4 1512a1abebd24193ba7ecafebe4cfb8b
#: 2ca3957070cd42219cfb1458c8c4c23c 58a6dc8fc50f413fb7717a459ebe434e
#: 963c7b2c86bc42b8a88cb57e7b09a88f af801337cc9a4bf2b1f015ddaec17562
#: cb1b8105813045878e333cd0bb11b8d2 e043a9157bc340cc813ee4b7889f8f79
msgid ""
"The APM 2.5 board requires no assembly, and is ready for firmware. You have "
"a choice of side or top entry pin configuration, in order to accommodate a "
"variety of installations. You'll see this option when you order."
msgstr "APM 2.5 板无需组装，可直接烧录固件。您可以选择侧入式或顶入式引脚配置，以适应各种安装方式。订购时会提供此选项。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-apm25-and-26-overview.rst:25
#: ../../source/docs/common-apm25-and-26-overview.rst:39
#: 0486ac529abb43e782385056c8c4f7b0 35db3bbdfe8c4accb629f346a7938e04
#: 50b662f94f93446ebe4edc4d8f55c507 8eed2d42b12d47b2823ce994b52b6da2
#: b77e606d0afc4b2b83877ef47af171c5 bd23f00db93749289cc7c11e702b27a1
#: d44ec506623f437e9ae80e9d7f347bfb d6337ec86f4449c2b797520dbbf50e10
msgid ""
"This page gives you a look under the hood, and goes into more detail about "
"the design of this board."
msgstr "本页让您深入了解飞控内部，并详细介绍该板的设计。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-apm25-and-26-overview.rst:28
#: ../../source/docs/common-apm25-and-26-overview.rst:42
#: 297989833348458daf219cb76ca8965e 4bb4f668c8f64100ba3925ecf2755a33
#: 4fbf3b4b7bd34707856f965a328506c5 83a16af9f1a94f95aad0371f39dec78f
#: 9cd8ad652c604ddda5eff05eefd9224f c6c868876ec74c66a0113a802646db3e
#: cae74dd8bf2e40c38abd5614e9db504c e5f9fb5b67c14d90b763ff43dd67155c
msgid ""
"The APM 2.5 has some improvements over the APM 2.0, but they both have a "
"very similar layout and function."
msgstr "APM 2.5 对 APM 2.0 有所改进，但两者的布局和功能非常相似。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-apm25-and-26-overview.rst:32
