#: 0f22324fdf714402a02e7cba725d42cb 5d1b96339c264cde9d6e4c3d05e9e652
#: 65c48b9de3554a7ebeb4ecbeba7528a8 7a66bd64ade34494a850c1ad391a9b55
#: cfc794bb350a4e9babf765e197607427 d10b5c80fb6b4e43b104ebee65496584
#: d3da34a5c8ea4451a96295502481392d e6da6df09a4844999e22f552bfc9dc43
msgid "APM 2.6"
msgstr "APM 2.6"

#: ../../source/docs/common-apm25-and-26-overview.rst:34
#: ../../source/docs/common-apm25-and-26-overview.rst:48
#: 163612c55e3b425bbe641e8fe6717494 1936403a921149409bee9b7372ed34b8
#: 23f354bfb74e4477919a789d56281142 8b4b145097be480dae75fedbfc05bc8e
#: 9514fc0aa6a24cd6ab40796b19787781 afafff7de0fd402ea626e0cc1a30aa2a
#: b5aed670225c4945824bf46c70252c73 fc6e6f51f7a94213be0fb982001f3f41
msgid ""
"**APM 2.6** is a revision of the APM that makes use of an external compass."
msgstr "**APM 2.6** 是 APM 的修订版，使用外置罗盘。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-apm25-and-26-overview.rst:36
#: ../../source/docs/common-apm25-and-26-overview.rst:50
#: 2d9de2f6748b4d419e2ba87b36d914ce 6fd0f1a3010843529bde27b0970f8723
#: 9d480eb2ac9c418284280be219253b2d a018760a79ed4144b9f3883359a48533
#: d3231e4176f64060adb93d980f621cae df253d7f2f50421d9b19c378e8dd8759
#: ea02f8862a944fdf8aefe55b2d6cbf7e ffadac449f5b4c9dbfd1d6cdff20079d
msgid ""
"The APM 2.6 has no on board compass, and is optimized for vehicles where the"
" compass should be placed as far from power and motor sources as possible to"
" avoid magnetic interference."
msgstr "APM 2.6 没有板载罗盘，专为需要将罗盘尽量远离电源和电机噪声源以避免磁干扰的飞行器而优化设计。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-apm25-and-26-overview.rst:39
#: ../../source/docs/common-apm25-and-26-overview.rst:53
#: 1605ec725d8d45f7a69abad7eb3640f6 193712a7dbd8471f84f45bc89fce2255
#: 49cf98b0b81f40d7b99ca6072797663f 6cf9753ec08e43b0b35e7e37b04de5ac
#: aca6aa7bd9de4ed09986f971a10f4c5f d858233a49824e679ae83f2ea856c7f6
#: e04ff1b4df9a4703a5c03c918dcf623c f99ce64705a243edaa2d3389e16042c9
msgid ""
"APM 2.6 is designed to be used with the 3DR GPS uBlox LEA-6 with Compass "
"module."
msgstr "APM 2.6 设计与 3DR GPS uBlox LEA-6 带罗盘模块配合使用。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-apm25-and-26-overview.rst:41
#: ../../source/docs/common-apm25-and-26-overview.rst:55
#: 1ae1829b1eb740288ae5871bb8ba255a 3383e13292f74f22856e962524378f9b
#: 3fd7d17b980049979bf6284aeb09d792 52986984a2fc43848ecae264a582ff8b
#: 66d40b89197947c4b6879567931c9127 6c574a206cbc4027a22ac069923d4c92
#: ab6d8895204e4ca8b36b8a1802665a39 b686adb093ba458b835afac4dac83198
msgid ""
"The GPS/Compass module may be mounted further from noise sources than the "
"APM itself."
msgstr "GPS/罗盘模块可以安装在比 APM 本身更远离噪声源的位置。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-apm25-and-26-overview.rst:43
#: ../../source/docs/common-apm25-and-26-overview.rst:57
#: 461885c150ac4e8f8e1df57d46011ec9 53af9504be3a4812870bd4a6724b3d88
#: 630f02a1171b40a9887ae4ea23ef559c 6efb081ed947405c8a4fb33107714b8b
#: 76e09ce320954c8ebc30c495d38062f0 89350093259648f6ab3e0f4b6f86846f
#: a278e75796634140a1a55599f2ade3d5 a856ca77b7a54cb2bba5742260bce34e
msgid ""
"APM 2.6 requires a GPS unit with an on board compass for full autonomy."
msgstr "APM 2.6 需要带板载罗盘的 GPS 单元才能实现完全自主飞行。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-apm25-and-26-overview.rst:45
#: ../../source/docs/common-apm25-and-26-overview.rst:59
#: 0c5ad2c8097d47eea6bf86f122560dc4 15d4332bac36461f9ed03c86bd2dcf4d
#: 22ca9a6a0eb548c9979250dc7d9dcd3f 234e02cd57df42399f743ea3f609d1fe
#: 27afff56bdf7473d97bf77e979cc113f 2fb6eef6424a488abb4a959675b2e2ff
#: 5ae930531d9a449aba17c55c97fe5675 c786e5135d704fc98db1c0d34eef9696
msgid ""
"For information on installing a 3DR GPS uBlox LEA-6 with Compass, visit "
":ref:`3DR Power Module <common-installing-3dr-ublox-gps-compass-module>`."
msgstr ""
"有关安装 3DR GPS uBlox LEA-6 带罗盘的信息，请访问 :ref:`3DR 电源模块 <common-installing-3dr-"
"ublox-gps-compass-module>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-apm25-and-26-overview.rst:52
