#: d9c3cab76f2c48de9904e024c964abbe ec28ccfd9f2d465f83ce82405e435367
msgid "Using the APM 2.5/2.6 Enclosure"
msgstr "使用 APM 2.5/2.6 外壳"

#: ../../source/docs/common-apm25-and-26-overview.rst:54
#: ../../source/docs/common-apm25-and-26-overview.rst:68
#: 1985718f84cf4ff794bd74bf654f5740 322221ad88b54e86b970c78f3485d830
#: 375865797f8d443587c9023af7c76ad9 662fdbc352ce402aa2c6b9581099272b
#: 6631de4a0aa54170939bd7d4bb5450c8 771debfe69404e1687928aa385a6945f
#: ad1e0529bd2e46feae5577a8fa4008ed b54a71194bd544ffbec60951cfe154e6
msgid ""
"The APM 2.5/2.6 board is shipped in an enclosure with foam protecting the "
"barometric pressure sensor, as shown here."
msgstr "APM 2.5/2.6 板随外壳一起出货，外壳中有泡沫保护气压传感器，如图所示。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-apm25-and-26-overview.rst:61
#: ../../source/docs/common-apm25-and-26-overview.rst:75
#: 017cf177edaa46a897bb7038630c6a0e 4b186c72edc845108ada2338976005b8
#: 5780f3dd696e4f23b6cdc8d9fca68697 87563d042dee466b835e1a89a15602ba
#: c967641c854849f49c257afb201cfda5 cef5650360d64ae2a3dbefced21b31b0
#: e2b7333160734d64a40901cd0db4659e ea90f29488ea4e09a5ddfba1cdebbab3
msgid "Not using the APM Enclosure"
msgstr "不使用 APM 外壳"

#: ../../source/docs/common-apm25-and-26-overview.rst:63
#: ../../source/docs/common-apm25-and-26-overview.rst:77
#: 6ece866f1ccf4498b8e7930474c148e3 724f405ef0784c2e9b16ee183799a031
#: 811f3522cc954056bb596671eeb15e25 87281ae756d4490fa1d5ffec0bd20d5a
#: 916f6edf28e74ce9ac9be30c9f3d11d2 a029abe0cab24f9f9ccd639ddbc5af24
#: b5941373f9654665967b1e72bf81a33e d176fa5b44be46d4b978dfda86877e25
msgid ""
"If you aren't using the enclosure, make sure to cover the barometric sensor "
"with some open cell foam, cotton padding or tissue to protect it from prop "
"wash, wind and turbulence. Also, the barometric sensor is sensitive to light"
" and readings can change by several meters from direct sunlight to shade. "
"Some type of light shield (on top of the foam) will minimize the effects of "
"light changes."
msgstr ""
"如果不使用外壳，请确保用开孔泡沫、棉垫或纸巾覆盖气压传感器，以防螺旋桨气流、风和湍流的影响。此外，气压传感器对光线敏感，从直射阳光到阴影处读数可能变化数米。某种遮光罩（放在泡沫上方）可将光线变化的影响降到最低。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-apm25-and-26-overview.rst:78
#: ../../source/docs/common-apm25-and-26-overview.rst:92
#: 315de20165cc4683a1d065480679dcbf 3c016c3eeb244bd79e852b56dd5ee6f9
#: 3ef81d07c8e5419ca41908ffa2c1162c 43631f2414e44c2c8422abd9fdff4a3a
