#: f47accf652894b188143abe2364294c4 f98e32dc56af4ccfbaf3d9430d988e2e
msgid "Explanation of solder jumper options on the bottom of the board"
msgstr "板底面焊桥选项说明"

#: ../../source/docs/common-apm25-and-26-overview.rst:106
#: ../../source/docs/common-apm25-and-26-overview.rst:92
#: 2519551eabe14914a8859825ffb35ab4 3a4c72f625cc44efb6466559b66deefa
#: 583afb861a79425596211de96975b168 6dcf73ade82b4b659fc7567f0482cd34
#: 8cb050b2229b40f29db98b02303d54e1 f61803813fb04f269a51c2b42d3e59c8
#: fe3680a2acb14c2f9f693d9b44cb566a fe54d11b35c9403c8a9d41b7f77aadba
msgid "Changing your telemetry to use UART2 (aka Serial3)"
msgstr "将数传更改为使用 UART2（即 Serial3）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-apm25-and-26-overview.rst:108
#: ../../source/docs/common-apm25-and-26-overview.rst:94
#: 0cb805cd6bad4d60adf49f5f984cf2a5 67e931c3a28841098e8988a117f42123
#: 7205597b029e4a98be810cf3f62d4547 83e4bc9b9b334b579d33dfd96aa19683
#: 9e9740248a384407a0d11fc352d0097f b3ed96c13a3a4fb39e29b4e79a5df6f0
#: cf2263ad395a455092cf582518025023 ec2561f48cc54c9ca0e53198890ee222
msgid ""
"By default an Xbee connected to the APM2 will use UART0 (aka \"Serial\" in "
"Arduino) which is shared with the USB as mentioned above. If you wish to "
"instead use UART2 (aka \"Serial3\") for telemetry you can change the "
"\"AutoMUX UART0\" jumper on the bottom of the APM2."
msgstr ""
"默认情况下，连接到 APM2 的 Xbee 将使用 UART0（Arduino 中的「Serial」），如上所述与 USB 共用。如果希望改用 "
"UART2（「Serial3」）进行数传，可以更改 APM2 底部的「AutoMUX UART0」焊桥。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-apm25-and-26-overview.rst:113
#: ../../source/docs/common-apm25-and-26-overview.rst:99
#: 00d77b20dacd420581c17efede0ca62f 220111f6078846579b9b8db7cd7f3504
