#: ../../source/docs/common-apm25-and-26-overview.rst:127
#: ../../source/docs/common-apm25-and-26-overview.rst:141
#: 194228571bdc475b90386732d510e345 25133d7e4cc349dd8a351d3a168a0163
#: 6dbf0742497c4b4688095c0508369881 7f70c716befa4c5cabc36e47f5236132
#: be585e4717ae46efb762b0251b9b374a cef70e8b4771405c86483bfbdc3c6188
#: eb44696c63a74183ae237248d3c85783 fb413e95d8394bb598a1bc73dcf2afd9
msgid "Analog input pins"
msgstr "模拟输入引脚"

#: ../../source/docs/common-apm25-and-26-overview.rst:129
#: ../../source/docs/common-apm25-and-26-overview.rst:143
#: 1f20b6a8d65845bca78fe620486d43b4 5cb35b3e3120416984e3570580c305fd
#: 7673a6c2a9ee4db0bb6b673f0cdb9cdd 8baa3c606b774b70bc0ff3fd4e66c5dc
#: bec729fc792b4a14abee9544ef536359 c54b7d2af9e244a688b093f7747cd7db
#: eec1351613dc4375b2c13e4f87321bfd f5462ecfecb8467a96ec83d51df40349
msgid ""
"Pin 0 to 8: The APM2 has a row of analog input pins down one side, labelled "
"A0 to A8 on the underside of the board. These are available as pin numbers 0"
" to 8 inclusive in PIN variables."
msgstr "引脚 0 至 8：APM2 一侧有一排模拟输入引脚，板底面标记为 A0 至 A8。在 PIN 变量中可用引脚编号为 0 至 8（含）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-apm25-and-26-overview.rst:133
#: ../../source/docs/common-apm25-and-26-overview.rst:147
#: 0d1cb787f58c437f9eb7aa784b2595ab 5dc5df22bba140bda13462f102633e60
#: 6b7156f6b283419c855d652a704dbdb8 739c79ae606147559679fffc0b7c83ae
#: 85b6d86e1fa8479092d64bdd21ad926b 8af254984d5440d890aca0a6c06d142a
#: ea000f985db84f89889bb9dbf4254f4e ec298d5acec14746b58615fa2b99eadf
msgid ""
"All these pins can take up to 5V and may be used for any general analog "
"input. They are commonly used for airspeed and sonar inputs."
msgstr "这些引脚均可承受最高 5V 电压，可用于任何通用模拟输入。通常用于空速和声纳输入。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-apm25-and-26-overview.rst:136
#: ../../source/docs/common-apm25-and-26-overview.rst:150
#: 00b676ba533d4b5bb298355de462525b 1785e228e21d4b948aadf648a294a0d7
#: 1f42d72c316646b9b9f4045e6b9d3b8f 5023fc048d304df181f4bc0f22280e0e
#: 6c5e5e4d569d4b82bf469f1b4b2be077 804f81c15cc44a1b86107d9fb3daf31d
#: b8c6fd22e2904b67822c3ea1e703c787 ba74bb198b9742c7b64e9acc2715e274
msgid ""
"Pin 12: power management connector current pin, accepts up to 5V, usually "
"attached to 3DR power brick with 17:1 scaling"
msgstr "引脚 12：电源管理连接器电流引脚，最高接受 5V，通常连接 3DR 电源模块，缩放比为 17:1"

#: ../../source/docs/common-apm25-and-26-overview.rst:139
#: ../../source/docs/common-apm25-and-26-overview.rst:153
#: 16fc4f4973c7478080ce465cc7b39052 23c92132237c4c2a801d7ab49d10583e
#: 2bd7b90edb504aada3afb3fe4be058ae 37b8bf07614f4fc39c801fa059c8406b
#: 4ac98acfc64849908a9a909d43dd9a57 886ba6b6e2584f15920bd63961fce4f2
#: dfe4b7525023472f9791130bd8261171 ffe16172f8b2452d95778217b97de647
msgid ""
"Pin 13: power management connector voltage pin, accepts up to 5V, usually "
"attached to 3DR power brick with 10.1:1 scaling"
msgstr "引脚 13：电源管理连接器电压引脚，最高接受 5V，通常连接 3DR 电源模块，缩放比为 10.1:1"

#: ../../source/docs/common-apm25-and-26-overview.rst:146
#: ../../source/docs/common-apm25-and-26-overview.rst:160
#: 071dd2cacf284a8b80fc1725f9bee0e8 13621d6ecb32425d9182338e8e16e350
#: 25e3f2329c4d422ea36dd8da841dd266 491480ea2ab4427b8d370d5b78259cb0
#: 810d57ef3877497f8f4c81fb0b87df6b 8dabb027d7214b8fb4893e8bf2088fbe
#: ae40b15fca594e8d98c2cf225dfb15a1 e65fd0107ccb4bbd9668e2ce0b4c8042
msgid "Digital output pins"
msgstr "数字输出引脚"

#: ../../source/docs/common-apm25-and-26-overview.rst:148
#: ../../source/docs/common-apm25-and-26-overview.rst:162
#: 12d53cd8076342adb65d0b68a53df6b3 153ee21b39324f5fb6cc9feff36899e0
#: 295bf29454714b4f8713a3ae9243a9c5 a1ffa4dddee0433c9e1f6b216bcc088e
#: a6076e5490874bd2980b9ba37a58dca4 a8727f97803d43da830214e8ed1493d2
#: b888915aa0fd4904a0b238427b5dfe59 fa79fc65d92f46a7bb77243e018e8194
msgid ""
"The APM2 uses the same set of 9 analog input pins as digital output pins. "
"They are configured as digital output pins automatically when you start to "
"use them as digital outputs."
msgstr "APM2 使用与数字输出引脚相同的一组 9 个模拟输入引脚。当开始将其用作数字输出时，它们会自动配置为数字输出引脚。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-apm25-and-26-overview.rst:152
#: ../../source/docs/common-apm25-and-26-overview.rst:166
#: 0d02b48ad6bb4d1f97269bc2336c1464 49fc341c7a1741b08e5abcf46872b01f
#: 4e76654768264af889e4c6d970424597 512d97df21e74eec96d7d23d5518564a
#: 9141a75cba064c7f9ea3657bff3f06e4 ac34c425eae64b269c85372b3986c84d
#: b399ff20dff84ffc95287b015a370a51 cfd3bf52d9ff4b29b14ff3800d26e27d
msgid ""
"Pin 54 to 62: You need to add 54 to the pin number to convert from an analog"
" pin number to a digital pin number. So pin 54 is digital output pin on the "
"A0 connector. Pin 58 is A4 etc."
msgstr ""
"引脚 54 至 62：需要在模拟引脚编号上加 54 以转换为数字引脚编号。因此引脚 54 是 A0 连接器上的数字输出引脚，引脚 58 是 "
"A4，依此类推。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-apm25-and-26-overview.rst:156
#: ../../source/docs/common-apm25-and-26-overview.rst:170
#: 1c186a917d914081a88d7f265c1427e4 3f008ffb9933413eb2857d0a3092f4eb
#: 4f8fd33ef6364db2b6c2d0edc4d8e4ab 518248104b34489c81a821062bac6167
#: daf1875b80624ea390be8b6ac8260c30 ee0ad70458234ffdaddd1e5983c0d04b
#: fd97697436db40d788e1d49cbe16fe76 fedb588fbf8c47a893d026a528b5a4eb
msgid ""
"These pins are usually used with the RELAY_PIN to RELAY_PIN4 parameters, "
"allowing you to control things like camera shutter, bottle drop etc. They "
"are also used as sonar \"stop\" pins allowing you to have multiple sonars "
"and not have them interfere with each other."
msgstr ""
"这些引脚通常与 RELAY_PIN 至 RELAY_PIN4 "
"参数配合使用，允许您控制相机快门、投弹等。它们也用作声纳「停止」引脚，使您可以使用多个声纳而不互相干扰。"

